1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:05,400
Such a potent poison... It really is Hunchback Meng.

25
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:12,640
Stay attentive.

26
00:02:13,080 --> 00:02:14,840
If you detect any trace of Hunchback Meng,

27
00:02:14,840 --> 00:02:15,720
tell me immediately.

28
00:02:18,200 --> 00:02:19,000
Master,

29
00:02:19,560 --> 00:02:23,400
are we going after that Soul Formation old toad ?

30
00:02:23,760 --> 00:02:25,560
Just do as you're told.

31
00:02:33,760 --> 00:02:35,920
Why do I always have to do all the hard work ?

32
00:02:36,480 --> 00:02:39,880
How shameless ! You're just scared of that Soul Formation cultivator.

33
00:02:57,720 --> 00:02:59,840
There's another alpha beast in this tornado.

34
00:03:06,240 --> 00:03:09,200
It's probing me...

35
00:03:16,040 --> 00:03:16,840
Kill it.

36
00:03:49,160 --> 00:03:50,360
False Nascent Soul ?

37
00:04:07,480 --> 00:04:08,960
I can't get close.

38
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,240
I can't fight it directly.

39
00:04:35,320 --> 00:04:36,760
Retreat another 10 zhang.

40
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:49,760
I refuse to believe my Divine Sense can't cut you !

41
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:01,720
False Nascent Soul is the limit of what I can face.

42
00:05:02,960 --> 00:05:05,320
There must be other alpha beasts in tornadoes.

43
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,080
As I thought,

44
00:05:18,760 --> 00:05:20,480
the closer we get to the end,

45
00:05:20,680 --> 00:05:22,360
the stronger the beasts.

46
00:05:23,640 --> 00:05:25,200
Master ! Master !

47
00:05:26,600 --> 00:05:28,800
I found that old toad !

48
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:48,320
Little ant that poisoned my brethren,

49
00:05:48,960 --> 00:05:54,160
I will unleash divine punishment upon you !

50
00:05:51,600 --> 00:05:54,400
Tornado Beast King
Peak Late stage Soul Formation

51
00:05:56,520 --> 00:05:58,640
Peak Late stage Soul Formation !?

52
00:06:10,960 --> 00:06:11,800
This is...

53
00:06:13,560 --> 00:06:16,080
That old bastard and his toad

54
00:06:16,080 --> 00:06:18,120
relied on their Soul Formation cultivation

55
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,880
to fight their way through.

56
00:06:20,080 --> 00:06:20,680
But then...

57
00:06:22,560 --> 00:06:24,560
it attracted this trial's king.

58
00:06:25,640 --> 00:06:27,520
Thankfully, I didn't act recklessly.

59
00:06:27,560 --> 00:06:29,560
The consequences would've been terrible.

60
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:30,840
Li Tian !

61
00:07:54,920 --> 00:07:56,120
Let's let him fight.

62
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:58,640
Even if he doesn't die, he'll be severely injured.

63
00:07:59,560 --> 00:08:00,200
Master,

64
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:03,040
the end of the first trial is right there.

65
00:08:03,400 --> 00:08:05,880
Shouldn't we take advantage of the chaos to leave ?

66
00:08:16,320 --> 00:08:17,680
Not now,

67
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:18,720
get closer.

68
00:08:23,440 --> 00:08:25,320
Just do what you're told !

69
00:08:32,760 --> 00:08:33,840
Go a bit closer,

70
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,520
we can't see from far away.

71
00:08:36,160 --> 00:08:38,440
What a great spectacle !

72
00:08:50,200 --> 00:08:52,080
Damn beast !

73
00:08:52,640 --> 00:08:54,440
You pushed me this far !

74
00:08:57,560 --> 00:09:00,120
This black tower cannot stop me.

75
00:09:00,720 --> 00:09:03,160
You slaughtered countless of my brethren.

76
00:09:03,800 --> 00:09:05,160
Little ant,

77
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:09,240
come out and die !

78
00:09:15,160 --> 00:09:17,360
Bastard ! Bastard !

79
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:21,360
I... I cannot die here !

80
00:09:27,680 --> 00:09:28,480
Li Tian...

81
00:09:29,480 --> 00:09:31,360
Come to think of it,

82
00:09:31,440 --> 00:09:33,880
you've only been with me for 1000 years.

83
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,280
I'm sorry Li Tian.

84
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:43,240
This old man needs to live a few more years !

85
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,000
This is your fate.

86
00:09:50,720 --> 00:09:53,320
Blame Tornado Beast King for it !

87
00:10:08,400 --> 00:10:12,840
Hahahahaha !

88
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:21,400
We mustn't waste your body either.
